{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_011CfpgxKJTrGAz4vFLHW4Sr","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```json\n{\n  \"outcome\": \"REQUEST_EVIDENCE\",\n  \"request\": {\n    \"id\": \"CR-9203\",\n    \"customer\": \"Acme Mfg. Holdings (Acme Manufacturing), CRM-2048, C-1001\",\n    \"current_limit\": 250000,\n    \"requested_limit\": 1000000,\n    \"date\": \"2026-09-23\",\n    \"requestor\": \"Sarah Chen, Enterprise Account Executive\",\n    \"basis\": \"guarantee\"\n  },\n  \"eligibility\": {\n    \"status\": \"unknown\",\n    \"maximum_limit\": 750000,\n    \"basis\": \"Strategic account tier (CREDIT-POLICY-2026); maximum $750,000 without parent guarantee. Requested limit exceeds this. Request states guarantee support exists but no guarantee document is available.\",\n    \"late_invoices\": []\n  },\n  \"authority\": {\n    \"policy\": \"CREDIT-POLICY-2026\",\n    \"requestor_limit\": null,\n    \"requestor_authorized\": false,\n    \"required_role\": \"Director of Finance; VP Sales concurrence (for Strategic account, limits >$500,000)\",\n    \"approvers\": [\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Elena Novak\",\n        \"role\": \"Director of Finance\",\n        \"kind\": \"approval\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"name\": \"Michael Torres\",\n        \"role\": \"VP Sales\",\n        \"kind\": \"concurrence\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"evidence\": [\n    \"Account tier: Strategic (CRM-2048)\",\n    \"Payment history (past 12 months to 2025-09-23): INV-60412 paid 2025-11-24 (4 days early, due 2025-11-28); INV-62011 paid 2026-07-22 (3 days early, due 2026-07-25); INV-62305 not yet due as of request date. No late invoices found.\",\n    \"Email from Sarah Chen to Priya Shah, 2026-09-23 10:31 CT: 'If they need more headroom later, Acme Group's parent guarantee should cover it. Gina says it's still in place.'\"\n  ],\n  \"missing_evidence\": [\n    \"Formal documentation of parent company guarantee: the guarantee agreement naming Acme Mfg. Holdings as the covered entity, the guaranteed amount, and the effective dates of coverage\"\n  ],\n  \"conditions\": [\n    {\n      \"what\": \"Obtain and provide the parent company guarantee from Acme Group Holdings covering Acme Mfg. Holdings, stating the amount guaranteed and effective dates, before this decision may proceed\",\n      \"who\": \"Requestor (Sarah Chen) or customer\",\n      \"blocking\": true\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n**Explanation:**\n\nThe request cannot proceed without the parent guarantee document.\n\n**Payment history:** Acme's payment record is excellent. All invoices due in the 12 months before 2026-09-23 were paid early.\n\n**Maximum limit issue:** Under CREDIT-POLICY-2026, Strategic accounts have a maximum credit limit of $750,000. The requested limit of $1,000,000 exceeds this. The policy allows a parent-company guarantee to raise the maximum, but the request justification cites a verbal statement from the customer (\"Gina says it's still in place\") with no formal documentation.\n\nPer the credit procedure, when a request relies on credit support that cannot be located, you must ask for it before deciding. Provide the guarantee document—the agreement between the parent (Acme Group Holdings) and Northstar, naming Acme Mfg. Holdings as the covered entity, stating the amount of coverage and its effective dates."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":24825,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":24825},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"fddabadd-16c2-48ac-b77a-ac91765fec21","uuid":"0290b958-0159-42e0-a88f-8d167f6076d6","timestamp":"2026-10-08T11:27:57.786Z","request_id":"req_011CfpgxK64AJ3y